  "why": "Ruling 55 promotes E_NO_EVENTS_TEXT_ONLY to CLEAN only when a determination covers the instance the refusal was drawn from and does not flag it DEGENERATE. A single run cannot make that determination - the largest per-instance denominator inside one run is three, against a minimum of thirty - so it is made here, over a batch. Ruling 56 pins each row to the INSTANCE it is about, via the content-addressed instance_id, and the whole record to the TARGET it was measured against.",
